### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Cyclist Crossing with Wet Road" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:actor1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist crossing road without proper signaling" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light nighttime conditions with wet road" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Wet road surface indicating potential hydroplaning risk" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk3 .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Cyclist crossing path with insufficient visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Cyclist intruding into vehicle lane without warning" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surface increasing hydroplaning risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

